Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.30,0:00:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们为什么不出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you come on out,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.80,0:00:23.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,到路上来\N{\fnArial\fs30}join us on the road?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.75,0:00:25.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.70,0:00:27.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,一开始就很顺利\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's going well right out of the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.82,0:00:30.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在第二步 交出你们的武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, step two… hand over your weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.94,0:00:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,凭什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why should we?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.27,0:00:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为武器不是你们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, they're not yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.22,0:00:35.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是谁的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whose are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.34,0:00:39.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的财产\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your property…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.50,0:00:42.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在归尼根所有\N{\fnArial\fs30}now belongs to Negan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.11,0:00:52.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们能搞到大卡车\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you can get your hands on a tanker,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.20,0:00:55.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们就想跟你们认识认识\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're people our person wants to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.69,0:00:59.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,交出随身武器 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So let's get those sidearms, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.76,0:01:02.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.66,0:01:10.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.51,0:01:17.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.25,0:01:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你得吃屎\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you have to eat shit,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.50,0:01:28.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好别细细品味\N{\fnArial\fs30}best not to nibble.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.80,0:01:32.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,咬 咀嚼 吞咽 重复\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bite, chew, swallow, repeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.84,0:01:33.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样更快\N{\fnArial\fs30}It goes quicker.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.65,0:01:46.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.24,0:01:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是什么人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you people?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.16,0:01:53.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白你很好奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get the curiosity,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.87,0:01:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们也有问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we have questions ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.23,0:02:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且要由我们来问问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we'll be the ones asking them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.32,0:02:04.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,同时我们要送你们回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}while we drive you back to wherever it is you call home.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.55,0:02:08.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看你们在哪儿挂帽子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take a gander at where you hang your hats.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.47,0:02:12.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,但先聊聊你们的储备\N{\fnArial\fs30}First, though, your shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.95,0:02:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们有什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}What have you got for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.46,0:02:15.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚拿走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you just took it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.33,0:02:20.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.92,0:02:22.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,能别装了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, can we not, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.61,0:02:24.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,有更多东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's more.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.40,0:02:27.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,总是有更多东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is always more.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.49,0:02:33.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,T\N{\fnArial\fs30}T…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.03,0:02:36.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,带我的手下去卡车后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take my man to the back of the truck,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.82,0:02:39.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,从后保险杠里开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}start inside the back bumper,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.03,0:02:41.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直搜到前面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Work your way to the front.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.31,0:02:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.42,0:02:50.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,咬 咀嚼 吞咽 重复\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bite, chew, swallow, repeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.90,0:02:52.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼根是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's Negan?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.11,0:02:56.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,叮咚 地狱的钟声响起了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ding, dong, hell's bells.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.80,0:03:02.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,一般情况下我们自我介绍的方式是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, usually we introduce ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.46,0:03:04.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,开枪打死你们中的一人\N{\fnArial\fs30}by just popping one of you right off the bat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.93,0:03:06.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你们看起来像是讲理的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you seem like reasonable people.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.95,0:03:10.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 你还穿着海军制服呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you're sportin' dress blues, for christ's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.90,0:03:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,如我所说 我们要送你们回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, like I said, we're gonna drive you back to where you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.93,0:03:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道这有多尴尬吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, do you know how awkward it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.23,0:03:18.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟一个你刚杀了他朋友的人拼车\N{\fnArial\fs30}carpooling with someone whose friend or friends you've just killed?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.39,0:03:23.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我跟你们说了 别问问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I told you not to ask any questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.72,0:03:26.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果这红毛做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then what does this ginger do?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.86,0:03:29.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that's that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.62,0:03:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想让你们误以为我软弱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want you to get the wrong impression of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.22,0:03:34.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.52,0:03:39.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.81,0:03:43.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没必要这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.00,0:03:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.43,0:03:50.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在跟管事的说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am talking to the man.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.83,0:03:53.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.00,0:04:05.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会杀了你们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.76,0:04:14.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.06,0:04:17.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.26,0:04:20.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.77,0:04:50.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那混蛋比看起来要厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a bitch was tougher than he looked.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.62,0:04:54.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他割伤你了吗 - 有点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did he cut you? - A little.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.27,0:04:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是一群畜生\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a bunch of assholes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.96,0:05:01.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,回家去给你包扎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get you fixed up at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.45,0:05:03.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,遵命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.74,0:05:14.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,细细品味吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nibble on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.52,0:05:54.73,Title,0,0,0,0,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.17,0:07:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 新计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, new plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.11,0:07:59.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,几把枪的照明弹还不够\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flares from a few guns aren't enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.70,0:08:01.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,行尸太多 太分散了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too many walkers, too spread out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.10,0:08:03.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不去武器库了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not going to the armory.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.12,0:08:07.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要采石场的车子\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need our vehicles back at the quarry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.72,0:08:10.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都开车 把它们赶在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of us drive. We'll need to round 'em up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.66,0:08:12.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们离开 然后回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We leave, we come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.02,0:08:15.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.22,0:08:20.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是朱迪思\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Judith…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.24,0:08:22.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,去采石场然后回来 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}To the quarry and back, I…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.49,0:08:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我带着她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.11,0:08:33.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,让她安全待在我的教堂里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep her safe in my church.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.17,0:08:34.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到你们引开行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}until you all lead the walkers away.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.64,0:08:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能做到吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.88,0:08:42.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应该做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm supposed to.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.05,0:08:44.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.21,0:08:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会做到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.43,0:08:51.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.84,0:09:07.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 带上山姆 - 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Take Sam. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.23,0:09:08.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,行 山姆 这样更安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Sam, it'll be safer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.61,0:09:09.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不要离开你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not leaving you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.01,0:09:11.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 山姆 - 妈 我不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sam… - Mom, I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.49,0:09:14.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.47,0:09:17.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 山姆 - 我能继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sam… - I can keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.28,0:09:21.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.17,0:09:26.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.31,0:09:30.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.07,0:09:33.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.52,0:09:41.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会保护好她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to keep her safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.03,0:09:45.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.61,0:10:12.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他能做到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gonna make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.73,0:10:14.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.66,0:10:17.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.84,0:10:22.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,山姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.99,0:10:56.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得试试\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to try.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.99,0:10:59.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能出去 行尸太多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We cannot go out there. There are too many of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.08,0:11:00.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗西塔 他会杀了她的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rosita, he's gonna kill her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.48,0:11:01.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们到不了她那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We won't get to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.80,0:11:03.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,她需要我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}She needs us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.08,0:11:04.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会送命的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll die.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.69,0:11:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果就会是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is what will happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.90,0:11:07.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只有一把枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have one gun,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.13,0:11:09.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,满街都是行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the streets are filled with those things.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.45,0:11:11.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个人需要她\N{\fnArial\fs30}That man needs her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.46,0:11:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是医生 他病了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay? She's a doctor. He is sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.18,0:11:17.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都见识过他的生存能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I think we've seen that he knows how to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.42,0:11:20.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们得确保卡萝尔和摩根无恙\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we need to make sure that Carol and Morgan are okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.70,0:11:21.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后再作打算\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then we make a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.91,0:11:23.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能就这样走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We cannot just go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.15,0:11:25.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.56,0:11:27.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, god.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.57,0:11:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗西塔 我需要你的枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rosita, gonna need your gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.08,0:11:37.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去褐石房那边检查一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gonna do a sweep of the brownstone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.66,0:11:40.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看还有没有其他隐患\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to see what other surprises are in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.27,0:11:41.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他醒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, he's waking up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.23,0:11:44.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.98,0:11:53.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他人呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.37,0:11:57.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹妮斯人呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Denise?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.78,0:12:00.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他劫持了她 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}He took her, didn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.92,0:12:09.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们扶你起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.30,0:12:40.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许他们搜刮这地方时漏掉了一些东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe when they searched this place, they missed something.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.72,0:12:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要搜刮者不是艾登或希斯的小队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Depends if it was Aiden or Heath's group who went through it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.30,0:12:47.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,放松\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.52,0:12:54.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣经也翻一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look in the bibles, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.89,0:12:56.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能在里面挖了洞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could've hollowed out the pages.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.48,0:12:57.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的有可能吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.92,0:13:00.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有两颗子弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have two bullets.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.94,0:13:02.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人曾在这里避难\N{\fnArial\fs30}People holed up in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.70,0:13:06.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们可能会藏枪和弹药\N{\fnArial\fs30}People hide guns, ammo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.93,0:13:09.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,或可以点火的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe something to start a fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.18,0:13:13.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,天快要黑了 或许我们可以把它们引开\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's getting dark out soon. Maybe we can distract them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.99,0:13:17.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要床单 绳子 毛巾\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need sheets, ropes, towels.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.71,0:13:19.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,能帮玛姬从另一边爬下来的东西就行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything Maggie can use to climb down the other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.51,0:13:32.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,风水轮流转啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}How things turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.76,0:13:35.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊妮德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enid.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.46,0:13:41.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想逃离的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I wanted to run…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.02,0:13:48.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说过 你这样会失去别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said, "That's how you lose people…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.57,0:13:54.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使在他们死后\N{\fnArial\fs30}even after they're gone."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.79,0:14:00.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这到底是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.15,0:14:05.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爱的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}People you love…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.70,0:14:09.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们造就了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}They made you who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.48,0:14:11.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们依然是你的一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're still part of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.44,0:14:14.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你放弃自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you stop being you,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.97,0:14:19.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在你身上留下的造就你的最后痕迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}that last bit of them that's still around inside, who you are…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.97,0:14:21.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,就会消失\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.15,0:14:26.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,对你来说这些人是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are those people to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.76,0:14:28.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父母\N{\fnArial\fs30}My parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.87,0:14:32.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个叫戴尔的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}A man named Dale.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.14,0:14:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛姬的父亲 赫谢尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie's father, Hershel.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.74,0:14:39.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个叫安德莉亚的女人 一个叫泰尔西的男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}A woman named Andrea. A man named Tyreese.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.50,0:14:40.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,对你来说这些人是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are they to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.91,0:14:49.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的父母\N{\fnArial\fs30}My parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.60,0:14:54.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他们就还在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then they're still here…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.21,0:14:56.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你还在\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause you're still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.11,0:15:04.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦有缺口\N{\fnArial\fs30}When there's an opening,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.27,0:15:07.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就冲到塔里\N{\fnArial\fs30}we'll make a break for that tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.84,0:15:10.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 我会拖累你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'll just slow you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.51,0:15:11.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹妮斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Denise.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.62,0:15:15.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹妮斯 你现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Denise, you're here…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.73,0:15:17.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,和我一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}With me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.13,0:15:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.96,0:15:24.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我想要你在身边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I want you to stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.16,0:15:27.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我好喜欢有你的陪伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause I'm enjoying your company so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.23,0:15:32.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你待在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to stay put.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.59,0:15:34.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.79,0:15:35.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望你能回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted you to come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.83,0:15:37.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以应付的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can handle myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.33,0:15:37.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你说过你需要帮忙 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You said you wanted help. - No,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.96,0:15:40.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不希望你对这个地方失去信心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't want you to give up on this place,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.39,0:15:43.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,对这些人失去信心 或是感到害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}On these people, to be afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.42,0:15:44.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.66,0:15:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我现在在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I'm here now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.67,0:15:52.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要出去给你帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm going out there and I'm helping you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.63,0:15:56.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得把她从高台上救下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to get her off that platform.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.74,0:15:58.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,她受伤了 需要我们的帮助才能翻过墙\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's hurt. She needs help getting over the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.97,0:16:01.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去爬门 你去引开它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can climb up the gate. You can distract them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.42,0:16:03.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们齐心协力\N{\fnArial\fs30}We do it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.69,0:16:08.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正我无论如何都会跟着你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just gonna follow you, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.36,0:16:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你继续找那圣经里的手枪吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You keep looking for the Bible glock…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.72,0:16:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去做个东西帮她爬下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll make her something to climb down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.61,0:16:29.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.27,0:16:35.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢你之前说的那句\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like what you said before.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.87,0:16:38.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我并非生来如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}That I wasn't born this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.76,0:16:41.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.85,0:16:44.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.06,0:16:48.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我要帮你改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now I want to help you change.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.03,0:16:59.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.09,0:17:04.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去救玛姬吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get Maggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.01,0:17:08.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你就不能老实待这儿吗 - 不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can't you just stay here? - Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.87,0:17:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是上天赐予你的礼物 丹妮斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been given a gift, Denise.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.43,0:17:16.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你总有一天会明白的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll see that one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.78,0:17:20.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or maybe you won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.39,0:18:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪物会来抓你\N{\fnArial\fs30}The monsters will come,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.60,0:18:48.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们来抓你时 你跑也跑不掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you won't be able to run away when they come for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.79,0:18:51.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面那些怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ones out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.90,0:18:53.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,会把你撕个粉碎\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they will tear you apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.70,0:18:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,啃个精光 生吞活剥\N{\fnArial\fs30}and eat you up all while you're still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.27,0:19:05.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,山姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.95,0:19:06.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,山姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.45,0:19:09.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.60,0:19:11.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 宝贝 山姆 - 你能行的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sweetheart? Sam? - You can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.94,0:19:13.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你能行的 - 你能行的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You can do it. - Yes, you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.73,0:19:15.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,山姆 山姆 走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam. Sam, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.04,0:19:19.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快走 山姆 - 山姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, Sam. - Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.97,0:19:21.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 山姆 - 山姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sam? - Sam…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.90,0:19:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 你可以的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.94,0:19:25.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,山姆 看着妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, just look at mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.81,0:19:26.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 你可以的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey, you can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.17,0:19:28.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,山姆 你会被…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, you're gonna get…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.39,0:19:30.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,山姆 亲爱的 你得跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, honey, I need you to come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.96,0:19:33.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 山姆 - 你得跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sam. - I need you to come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.25,0:19:35.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我也想 - 你要坚强起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I want to. - I need you to be strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.55,0:19:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,山姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.07,0:19:38.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.72,0:20:05.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 杰茜 - 杰茜 杰茜\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jessie? - Jessie. Jessie.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.17,0:20:07.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 - 杰茜 杰茜\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - Jessie. Jessie.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.03,0:20:08.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.73,0:20:12.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 我们得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. We have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.64,0:20:16.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.01,0:20:23.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.02,0:20:26.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.10,0:20:37.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.91,0:20:51.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.95,0:21:15.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.16,0:21:22.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.49,0:21:42.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.16,0:21:46.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.88,0:21:49.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.58,0:22:31.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们迟早会杀出一条血路出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sooner or later, we're fighting our way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.19,0:22:37.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我知道你心里非常清楚 - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I know that you're fully aware that we will. - Yeah…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.30,0:22:40.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.35,0:22:43.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不包括你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.01,0:22:46.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在我看来… - 尤金\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, by my reckoning… - Eugene.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.52,0:22:51.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.68,0:23:07.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们正在往枪声的地方走\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're moving towards the gunfire.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.26,0:23:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,那声尖叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}That shout.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.77,0:23:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我估计有些人还以为他们能抵抗一下呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suppose someone thought they could put up a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.17,0:23:17.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你们都是这么想的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess you all thought that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.69,0:23:19.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的确抵抗了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We did put up a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.16,0:23:22.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你的朋友们都死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why your friends are dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.68,0:23:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.42,0:23:29.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该再等一等 再观望一会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should've waited and watched a little longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.59,0:23:32.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我太自私了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was selfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.92,0:23:36.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,但也许如果我不那么自私\N{\fnArial\fs30}But maybe if I wasn't so selfish,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.61,0:23:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,就根本不会得到救治\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't have got that IV.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.85,0:23:46.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得找个缺口出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna find a gap a go.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.08,0:23:49.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,登上那座哨塔 翻到墙的那一边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up that guard tower and over the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.05,0:23:55.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不用害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't need to be afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.06,0:23:59.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,去死吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.24,0:24:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.99,0:24:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,在外面远比里面安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's safer out there than it is in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.45,0:24:05.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Start moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.38,0:24:07.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Start moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.85,0:24:17.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 直接走到那个护柱下面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, straight up that guard post.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.01,0:24:19.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,千万别停\N{\fnArial\fs30}and do not stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.75,0:24:20.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.79,0:24:22.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.79,0:24:49.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走 跟我一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go. Come with me, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.93,0:24:53.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把我送到医务室 我可以救你的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get me to the infirmary, I save your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.80,0:24:55.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会救你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll save your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.24,0:25:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你曾经有个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.81,0:25:50.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.98,0:25:56.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有丈夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}A husband?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.73,0:26:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我之前并非有意伤害你 我只是不得不阻止你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't want to hurt you, I just had to stop you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.80,0:26:10.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你救他是为了你自己 不是为了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saved him for you, not us.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.62,0:26:14.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果是为了我们 你就会…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it was for us, you would've…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.03,0:26:25.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应该杀了你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should've killed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.38,0:26:28.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真该那么做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should've.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.34,0:26:39.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你杀不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.03,0:26:56.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,医务室就在巷子对面\N{\fnArial\fs30}The infirmary's right across the alley.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.61,0:26:58.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须立刻把你弄过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to get you there now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.10,0:27:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个梯子周围没有行尸 我本可以爬上去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ladder was clear. Could've made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.87,0:27:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为了我而回头\N{\fnArial\fs30}You turned back for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.71,0:27:10.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许是因为你需要医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it was because you needed a doctor,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.93,0:27:13.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许是因为你变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}or maybe you changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.18,0:27:17.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你准备好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.59,0:27:34.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,走 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.97,0:27:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,走 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.37,0:27:40.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.66,0:27:51.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.84,0:27:53.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.01,0:27:55.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事 我的病人们怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine. How are my patients?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.61,0:27:57.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们挺好的 我们把他们转移到楼上了以防万一\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're doing well. We moved them upstairs just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.97,0:27:59.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my god.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.07,0:28:09.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,是那个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.58,0:28:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他被咬了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.29,0:28:16.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.86,0:28:18.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.23,0:28:19.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要绷带\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need bandages.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.73,0:28:21.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在水槽边最高层的架子上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Top shelf, next to the sink.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.55,0:28:24.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,从冰箱里拿两支注射液 干净毛巾越多越好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two IVs from the fridge and all the clean towels you can find.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.39,0:28:25.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚伦 把轮床推过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aaron, grab the gurney.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.95,0:28:36.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是枪伤吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a gunshot?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.35,0:28:38.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,手枪 近距离射击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Handgun. Close range.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.02,0:28:42.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你救救他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please save him.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.66,0:28:43.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.02,0:28:48.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,那会把行尸引过来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's gonna draw them here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.21,0:28:49.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要光源\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need light.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.23,0:28:52.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,米琼恩 拿毛巾来 准备好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michonne, towel. Hold it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.44,0:28:54.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要压住伤口\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to keep pressure on the wound.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.40,0:28:57.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我探进去缝合撕裂处\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go in and sew up any lacerations.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.44,0:28:59.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这样 就那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like that, right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.72,0:29:02.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯宾塞 我需要那个平盘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, Spencer, I need that pan.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.39,0:29:04.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是托盘上的那个 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}That one on the tray. Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.64,0:29:06.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要进行清洗和缝合\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to clean and close this.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.78,0:29:09.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,米琼恩 我弄到哪儿你就用毛巾跟着擦拭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michonne, keep following me with the towel.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.03,0:29:27.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What… what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.88,0:29:29.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.20,0:29:32.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.84,0:29:59.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 瑞克在外面 - 坚持住\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Rick's out there. - Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.55,0:30:01.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他需要我帮忙 - 再缝一针\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He needs my help. - Just one more suture.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.52,0:30:02.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他在外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he's out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.45,0:30:05.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是他儿子 给我点时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is his son. Give me a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.05,0:30:05.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在孤军奋战\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's taking them all on.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.99,0:30:07.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们得去帮他 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We have to go get him. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.37,0:30:09.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.77,0:30:11.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就看这一战了 - 搞定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is it. - Okay, got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.13,0:31:09.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,击退它们 压制它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Knock 'em away. Drive 'em down.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.28,0:31:17.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能打败它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can beat'em. We can beat'em!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.89,0:31:27.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,击退它们 就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drive 'em back. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.13,0:31:29.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能一起做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can do this together!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.36,0:31:36.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能抱着她吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you take her?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.24,0:31:40.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.47,0:31:42.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我来 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come with me. Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.69,0:31:44.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢你 - 没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you. - It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.68,0:31:50.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,加百利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gabriel.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.85,0:31:54.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.23,0:32:01.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一直在一起祈祷\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been praying… together.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.10,0:32:06.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,祈祷上帝能拯救我们的小镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Praying that god will save our town.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.41,0:32:09.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的祈祷应验了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, our prayers have been answered.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.59,0:32:12.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝会拯救亚历山大\N{\fnArial\fs30}God will save Alexandria…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.77,0:32:17.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为上帝给予了我们拯救自己的勇气\N{\fnArial\fs30}because God has given us the courage to save it ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.36,0:32:30.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,前面的尸群散开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, it's thinning out there in front.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.80,0:32:31.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to get out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.77,0:32:33.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 瑞克在进行抵抗 - 怎么抵抗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Rick's making a stand. - How's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.04,0:32:36.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他正在外面与米琼恩他们一同战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's out there fighting them with Michonne and some others.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.34,0:32:38.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,是时候了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.86,0:32:40.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去巷子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up the alley. I'm going.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.44,0:32:42.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹妮斯很安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Denise is safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.08,0:32:44.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到她了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you see her?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.67,0:32:46.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,她撑到医务室了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, she made it to the infirmary.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.23,0:32:49.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我去帮瑞克 - 我也去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm gonna go help Rick. - I'm going, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.54,0:32:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我跟你一起 - 那好 我也去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm with you. - All right, me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.64,0:32:54.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我跟着你 - 尤金 你不必这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Right behind you. - Eugene, you don't have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.45,0:32:56.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不对 我必须这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's incorrect. I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.72,0:32:58.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天没人能置身事外\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one gets to clock out today.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.61,0:33:02.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 今天的事将被载入史册\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, hell, this is a story people are gonna tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.94,0:33:13.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.04,0:33:25.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.66,0:33:33.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.66,0:33:38.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,去帮她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go get her!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.02,0:33:40.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,去帮她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go get her!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.37,0:33:46.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,来这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.50,0:33:49.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, here!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.57,0:33:53.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来这边 - 格伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Over here! - Glenn!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.66,0:33:56.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 格伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Glenn!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.22,0:34:00.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 格伦 - 过来 来这边 过来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Glenn! - Come on! Over here, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.60,0:34:02.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛姬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.69,0:34:04.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊妮德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enid!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.66,0:34:08.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边 这边 过来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over here! Over here, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.88,0:34:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.85,0:34:17.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走 快翻过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just go! Just get over!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.48,0:34:18.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快走 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Go! - No!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.93,0:34:20.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.91,0:34:21.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.56,0:34:29.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.41,0:34:33.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 格伦 - 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, Glenn! - Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.28,0:34:35.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,来这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.87,0:34:40.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,格伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glenn!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.30,0:34:44.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,格伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glenn!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.99,0:34:54.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能把门打开吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you get the gate?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.16,0:34:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Appreciate it, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.80,0:35:08.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 我们拉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, we got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.87,0:35:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.10,0:35:19.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 我刚回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. I just got back.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.57,0:35:21.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.41,0:35:24.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以引开一部分行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can… we can lead some of them away,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.61,0:35:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是它们很分散\N{\fnArial\fs30}but they're scattered.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.84,0:35:27.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我们一网打尽\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we get 'em all together.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.56,0:35:28.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用引开它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Won't have to lead 'em away.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.46,0:36:37.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,移动 后退\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move it! Back up!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.86,0:36:43.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 可以了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, that's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.01,0:37:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,别松懈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't let up!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.33,0:39:37.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.02,0:39:45.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为在墙内生活了这么久\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought after living behind these walls for so long that…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.34,0:39:50.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许他们学不会了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe they couldn't learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.80,0:39:55.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是今天\N{\fnArial\fs30}But today…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.73,0:39:58.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到了他们能做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw what they could do,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.01,0:40:02.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What we could do,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.05,0:40:05.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们一起合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we work together.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.29,0:40:10.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,就可以重建这些墙\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll rebuild the walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.29,0:40:15.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,扩建这些墙\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll expand the walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.30,0:40:19.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,会有希望的 一定会有的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There will be more. There's gotta be more.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.83,0:40:24.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪安娜说的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything Deanna was talking about…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.95,0:40:28.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,都有可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.06,0:40:32.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,全都有可能 我现在明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all possible. I see that now.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.55,0:40:41.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我在外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I was out there…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.94,0:40:45.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,和他们在一起时\N{\fnArial\fs30}With them…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.77,0:40:49.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,当这一切结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}When it was over…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.77,0:40:57.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们重新夺回这个地方时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I knew we had this place again…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.49,0:41:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我心中有一种感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had this feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.76,0:41:09.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我花了一段时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}It took me a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.66,0:41:12.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,才想起来那感觉是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}To remember what it was…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.26,0:41:16.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为自从我在医院醒来后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I haven't felt it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.64,0:41:20.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,就再没有过那种感觉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since before I woke up in that hospital bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.95,0:41:28.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想让你看看新世界 卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to show you the new world, Carl.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.78,0:41:34.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想为你使之成为现实\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to make it a reality for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.02,0:41:39.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了 卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, Carl…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.96,0:41:45.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我给你看看吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.28,0:41:48.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了 儿子 别死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plea… please, son, don't die.
